<view class="page"><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">JOB CATALOG</text><text class="title">最新岗位</text><text class="muted">岗位库由后台定时更新，本页只读取最新岗位并按你的条件匹配。</text><button class="primary" loading="{{searching}}" disabled="{{searching}}" bindtap="search">重新匹配</button><text wx:if="{{state.catalog}}" class="muted">当前最新岗位 {{state.catalog.freshJobCount || 0}} 个{{state.catalog.lastRefreshAt ? ' · 最近更新 ' + state.catalog.lastRefreshAt : ''}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在载入岗位库…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card"><text class="error">{{error}}</text><button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!state.run || !state.run.results || !state.run.results.length}}" class="card"><text class="card-title">暂无符合条件的最新岗位</text><text class="muted">请先确认简历和求职条件，或等待岗位库下一次更新。</text></view><view wx:else class="list"><view wx:for="{{state.run.results}}" wx:key="id" class="card selectable" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggle"><view class="check {{item.selected ? 'checked' : ''}}"></view><view><text class="card-title">{{item.job.title}}</text><text class="company">{{item.job.company}} · {{item.job.city}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.job.applicationEmail}}" class="muted">{{item.job.applicationEmail}}</text><text wx:else class="muted">官方入口申请</text><button class="detail" catchtap="detail" data-id="{{item.id}}">查看详情</button></view></view></view></block></view>
